{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"8b2a37010bbe5fdd993a1864c3ee79b477267d2746943c2795315b668fd28d94","digest":{"component_or_area":"compaction sweep","key_entities":["compact_txn.py:72","authorship.build_ticket_position_commit_map","authorship.py:294","compact.py:275","_commit_backfill","compact_trigger.run_sweep","compact_all_cli","src/rebar/_commands/compact.py:386","build_position_commit_map","authorship.py:466","build_introducing_commit_map","authorship.py:388","compact_txn.py:127","compact_rebuild.py:160","test_compact_sweep_perf.py","_build_authorship_ledger"],"problem_keywords":["git history walk under write lock","sweep stall","compaction performance","authorship ledger","store lock contention"],"propositions":["The store-wide compaction sweep executes one git log --full-history walk per ticket inside the store write lock, holding all writers for minutes at a time.","Per-ticket position map misses fall through to per-event wildcard walks with leading-wildcard pathspec that defeats pruning, making deployed cost worse than one-per-ticket.","The sweep stages uncommitted event files with git add -A instead of scoped paths, allowing concurrent writers' in-flight events to be swept into the compaction commit.","The sweep never yields between tickets despite probing write_lock_is_busy once before starting, so writers arriving mid-sweep wait for the full run.","The fix hoists the position-keyed history walk outside the lock, built once per sweep, and scopes staging to folded paths only."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787867116574514001,"uuid":"13acc83